WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.050
After the jab, Alex counters Ryu’s recorded Drive Impact.

2
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.850
The counter-Drive-Impact scores Punish Counter and causes crumple.

3
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.550
A dash and crouching heavy punch feed the forward Prowler light-punch pickup.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:10.250
OD Knee Smash completes the actual extension and hard knockdown.
